	(gr_text "T44-10  2-layer standard\nORDER AT PCBWAY AS: 2 layers / 0.4 mm / 4/4 mil / min hole 0.2 mm / ENIG\nFR-4 0.4 mm, 1 oz Cu, ENIG, green mask, white silk (bottom only)\ntrack/space >= 0.1 mm, copper to edge >= 0.15 mm (base pads excepted)\nvia 0.4/0.2 mm, hole-to-hole >= 0.25, copper-to-hole >= 0.15\ncomponents top side only; bottom = base pads + name\npinout: P1=GND, P4=I2C.CLK, P5=I2C.DAT, P10=+V"
